From 782084ae9355d4602c37af6c9abee8ef1b041573 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Justin <justurn@live.com>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 10:29:26 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: Lost Isles headless progress, bag management, vault +
 disenchant (F-219)

- interact: equip / destroy / item-target spell (disenchant + loot) /
  addon messages (CSMH: Item Vault deposit-all), INVENTORY_CHANGE_FAILURE
- runner: make_room (vault -> equip bags -> disenchant -> destroy last),
  GO data-field summons (escape pods), credit proxies through actionlists
  and item spells, passenger bar attacks (Thrall's cyclone), passenger exit,
  restored proto3 zero fields in rpc.py, tolerant turn-in
- supervise.sh: survive worldserver restarts (relog + resume)

Refs F-219

